OL,3,GNEWSARobin Hood's life-size working
OL,4,ADalek up for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA working Dalek from a memorabilia
OL,7,Fcollection previously owned by
OL,8,FNottingham's official Robin Hood is to
OL,9,Fbe auctioned.
OL,11,FTim Pollard was known for his portrayal
OL,12,Fof the legendary outlaw from 1996 until
OL,13,Fhis death in 2025, which led to an
OL,14,Foutpouring of mourning from residents.
OL,16,FHis belongings included a life-sized
OL,17,FDalek - complete with motors and
OL,18,Fjoystick controls - a limited-edition
OL,19,Fstudio-scale Eagle Transporter from
OL,20,FSpace: 1999, and several South African
OL,21,Fartifacts.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
