OL,3,GNEWSARobin Hood's life-size working
OL,4,ADalek up for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe collection - which numbers more
OL,7,Fthan 1,500 items - is being sold at
OL,8,FDerbyshire-based Hansons Auctioneers by
OL,9,FPollard's father-in-law, Stephen
OL,10,FPlummer, with the proceeds going
OL,11,Ftowards the care of Pollard's surviving
OL,12,Fdaughter.
